% --- System 2 ---
[V:1] | F F G | A2 A | E2 F | G3 | D E F | G2 A | F2 F | E3 |]
[V:2] | F F E | F2 F | C2 C | D3 | B, C D | E2 E | E D D | E3 |]
[V:3] | D C B, | C2 C | C2 C | B,3 | G, G, B, | B,2 C | F, B, A, | G,3 |]
